! The closed hearths' debts, carried onto the standing hearth

''A debt does not close by the closing of the hand that owed it.'' Every OWED entry the two closed rows carry moves here, re-measured against the tree on 2026-09-13 and re-stated as ''open'' or ''closed, with the evidence''. The row above keeps the debt as it stood AT CLOSE; this block keeps it as it stands TODAY. A reader who wants only "what still stands" reads this block and nothing else.

