|the meme hearth |''seam (b)'s ruling'' |''OPEN — the operator's'' |a child's save grades against its OWN authored text, or a child reads ungraded by law. `3dfb06170` refuted Phase 5's planned cure as a tautology. Carried at `syncer-seams-roundtable#/retirement` and `syncer-back-parity`, and it gates that floor's retirement |
|the meme hearth |''the replica read behind the return lane'' |''OPEN'' |the return lane itself CLOSED (`383301b4f`, the row under #/crossings) — the plane fires `onRefold` → `reverdict` and Docker reads //A gets the new slot ok//. What stays owed sits one layer under it: the announce filter reads a peer's crossroads replica ''as-of-last-sync'' (`offering.mem:312`), and no vector walks a verdict against a replica that has NOT synced. Re-derive: `grep -n "read/as-of-last-sync" bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/offering.mem` |
