  "packages/lararium-mesh/src/persona-kel.ts",
  "packages/lararium-mesh/src/veil-*.ts",
  "packages/lares-cli/src/commands/persona.ts",
]
```

!! The ground the closed hearths held

Recorded verbatim, in a fence `parseHolds` does not read (it keys on the exact `toml holds` opener). A hearth that reopens, or a new hearth taking one of these surfaces, copies its rows back into the live fence above and the gate arms on them unchanged.

